  m_text: 'Drag sensitivity - changes sensitivity of slope changes, larger value
    means faster, but less precise changes

    Respect original slopes - when it''s
    on, slopes are added on top of existing ones. When off, all slopes are changed
    to single value (area becomes flat)


    1. Drag mouse to select area you want
    to edit, shift-click to select multiple areas. Right-click while selecting cancels
    current selection, otherwise it deselects selected area

    2. Drag any handle
    inside selected area and move pointer up/down to edit heights. Right-click cancels
    this action'
